Phase-2 regression test: --proof-explanation works with the
Item B interface-dispatch path (--java-load-classpath-implementations).

Reuses the IfaceDispatch test class from iface-dispatch. The
expected output shows that the proof of `r == 1 || r == 2`
references the entry-point harness's Hello / Bye alternative
allocations (arg0a_alternative_java::Hello /
arg0a_alternative_java::Bye), confirming that the proof
explanation includes the nondet-switch construction the harness
emitted.
